---
args: { baseline: DebtOperationalBaseline, waves: DebtCampaignWaves, campaign: DebtCampaignRequest }
returns: DebtOutcomeAssessment
---
Compare the original workflow cost with the observed post-change cost under the same exposure definition. Preserve request volume, participating teams, and observation windows as denominators. If usage fell, do not label the lower event count an improvement without normalizing to exposure. Verify retired workarounds no longer appear in dependent runbooks and alerts; reopen an unmet mechanism even if its package shipped.
For each retired workaround bind dependencies = verifyRetiredWorkaroundDependents(workaroundId, campaign.runbookEvidence, campaign.alertEvidence). Preserve unresolved consumers in the outcome blockers.
